<section class="section founder-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal founder-card glass-card">
      <blockquote class="founder-quote">
        <p>
          Figma's MCP captures rendered UI as design layers. That's useful for design-to-code workflows. But AI agents still can't programmatically create on the canvas. They can't compose a layout, set typography, or batch-produce 50 slides from structured data.
        </p>
        <p>
          I built AI Happy Design to fill that gap. 130+ schema-validated commands. Batch mode at 27 ops/sec. Built-in design intelligence. Open source, runs locally, works with any AI agent you already use.
        </p>
      </blockquote>
      <div class="founder-attribution">
        <div class="founder-name">Ashraf Ali</div>
        <div class="founder-role">Creator, AI Happy Design</div>
      </div>
      <p class="founder-disclaimer">
        AI Happy Design is an independent open-source project, unaffiliated with Figma, Inc.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder-section {
    padding: 4rem 2rem 6rem;
  }

  .founder-card {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-color: rgba(255, 214, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .founder-quote {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;
  }

  .founder-quote p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .founder-quote p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .founder-attribution {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .founder-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .founder-role {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .founder-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .founder-card {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .founder-quote p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
